// Dialog :
"P4285574337" "I got a call from Fusionette. She told me that she's fine, thanks to you. So I owe you for that. She also said that the Lost did have the tape, but now that some Lost leader called Kurse has it. Then she told me that she's going to go get it by herself. Yeah, impulsive. She's in no shape to fight again, it's too soon. All I wanted was to find out what happened to my dad. I didn't want her to get hurt doing it."
// RandomFameString :
"P3095780110" "Welcome to Faultline, {HeroName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2488422313" "I just called the hospital. Fusionette got to the medical teleporter just fine. She told me that the Lost did have the tape, but now that one of their leaders, some guy called Kurse has it. Then she left. She's going to try and get the tape back on her own. Yeah, impulsive. She's in no shape to fight yet. All I wanted to do was find out what happened to my dad. I didn't want her to get hurt doing it."

